From b335d35af1c33867a3e3a1188ec52d2994ad20e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthew <matthewhale@live.com.au>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 23:45:54 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 42/59] XvT damage display on D (game.xvt_damage_display)

- D (info_damage, now key 239 USER_KEY_DAMAGE_DISPLAY) toggles X-Wing vs TIE
  Fighter's damage display instead of leaving flight for the damage screen;
  "All systems operational" when nothing is out. Off: X-Wing's 'd' as before.
- Up / Down pick a knocked-out system (shared with the F lists: the one opened
  last has the arrows), Enter moves it to the head of the repair order
  instead of matching speed (Damage_DisplayMfdPage). The saved order follows.
- Drawn at XvT element 133 (433,105 207x90) in MICRO64: green header, rows in
  repair order with red mm:ss repair time, highlighted row, green frame while
  it has the keys. Closes when everything is repaired.
- Settings: Game page "Damage Report (D)".
